    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i feel like the science side sounds a lot more \"evidence-based\" in your summary. could u go into more detail on the scientific side? like what specific data or modeling are they actually using to justify mandates? and then maybe give me the same level of detail for the civil liberties side so i can really weigh them against each other for my piece.",
